// Compaction on OpenCode 2 (shapes of recordings/ops.jsonl): the compact route admits an inbox item of
// type compaction (200), the title "Compacting" tells the test it was asked. A steer meanwhile is
// held; the statistics are the sync point. The compaction's run, summary deltas and usage show nothing
// but compaction end; then the held prompt runs. Last, a marker.
